1bit OS, Lemonade Server appliance
Lemonade Server by AMD, running on the 1bit engine

  Lemonade ................ http://<this-box>:13305   (API key: /etc/1bit/lemonade.env)
  1bit-release-check ...... PASS/FAIL for this boot, one line per check
  1bit-selftest ........... prove the engine answers
  1bit-board status ....... fans and power, on the boards we know
  apt update && apt upgrade  the box updates from 1bit.gg/apt
